    "options": {
      "A": "Checks by $4$ and by $6$ together prove divisibility by $24$.",
      "B": "Checks by $8$ and by $3$ together prove divisibility by $24$, because $\\operatorname{lcm}(8,3)=24$.",
      "C": "The tests by $8$ and by $3$ work because their prime powers together supply $2^{3}\\times 3$.",
      "D": "Divisibility by $24$ is what produces the separate checks by $8$ and by $3$."
